# Normalize line endings.
#
# LF is stored in the repository AND checked out into the working tree on every
# platform. Without this, Git's core.autocrlf=true (the Windows default) rewrites
# checkouts to CRLF, and Prettier — which defaults to endOfLine: "lf" — then fails
# every source file. That made `npm run lint` fail on a fresh Windows clone while
# passing on Linux CI.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-only scripts must keep CRLF or they will not run.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Never touch binaries.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
